        "collapsible-row-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Directions",
            "icon": "washing",
            "content": "<p>Wet hair completely. Pump desired amount (dependent on hair length) onto palm of hand. Gently massage into hair and scalp until it lathers. </p><p>Work the shampoo through the hair. For stronger lather, wet hair again and work in more shampoo.</p><p>Rinse scalp and hair thoroughly. <br/><br/>This shampoo is designed to cleanse your hair without stripping it of its natural oils or drying out the skin or scalp.</p><p>It should be followed with our Coconut Conditioner.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ingredients",
            "icon": "plant",
            "content": "<p>High-purity water, sodium C14-C16 olefin sulfonate, cocamidopropyl hydroxysultaine, cocamidopropyl betaine, coco-glucoside,<br/>vegetable glycerin (glycerin), sodium gluconate, sodium benzoate, caprylyl<br/>capryl glucoside, polysorbate 20 (food-grade), polyquaternium 10, citric acid,<br/>phenoxyethanol, caprylyl glycol, potassium sorbate, sodium benzoate</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-2": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Scent",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "content": "<p><em>Your choice of –</em></p><p><strong>Pure essential oils</strong> • hand selected by us from small farms all around the world.</p><p><em>and/or</em></p><p><strong>Phthalate-free fragrance oils</strong> • aromatic compounds made of GRAS safe synthetics. Certified free of the 624 carcinogens and 323 reproductive/developmental toxins listed under the <a href=\"https://oehha.ca.gov/proposition-65/proposition-65-list\" target=\"_blank\">Prop 65 act</a>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_xJDWUd": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ingredient Descriptions",
            "icon": "eye",
            "content": "<p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/charcoal-filtered-deionized-water\" title=\"What is High-Purity Water (charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-treated) and what does it do in products?\"><strong>High-Purity Water</strong></a><strong>  </strong>(charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-sanitized)</p><p><strong>Cocamidopropyl Bentaine (</strong>Naturally derived from coconut and palm-free. It is an environmentally friendly and biodegradable surfactant with mild chemistry.)<br/><br/><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-cocamidopropyl-hydroxysultaine-sultaine-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"What is Cocamidopropyl Hydroxysultaine (Sultaine) and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Cocamidopropyl Hydroxysultaine</strong></a><strong> </strong>(Naturally derived from coconut, palm-free, it is a biodegradable conditioning agent for hair and skin with high foaming and mild chemistry.)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-c14-16-alpha-olefin-sulfonate-aos-40-and-what-does-it-do\" title=\"What is Sodium C14-16 Alpha Olefin Sulfonate (AOS-40) and what does it do?\"><strong>Sodium C14-16 Olefin Sulfonate</strong></a><strong> </strong>(This mild-surfactant helps grab oil, dirt, and grease. It is also derived from coconuts, palm-free and is biodegradable.)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-glycerin-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"What is Glycerin and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Vegetable Glycerin (glycerin)</strong></a><strong> (</strong>Derived from vegetables. It is a biodegradable, powerful moisturizer that can increase skin hydration. Food-grade & Kosher.)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-coco-glucoside-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Coco-Glucoside and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Coco-Glucoside</strong></a><strong> </strong>(A plant-derived, biodegradable surfactant. It is mild and safe for sensitive skin.)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-caprylyl-capryl-glucoside-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"What is Caprylyl Capryl Glucoside and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Caprylyl Capryl Glucoside</strong></a><strong> </strong>(A plant-based surfactant that increases lather potential with mild chemistry for sensitive skin.)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-polyquaternium-7-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"What is Polyquaternium 7 and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Polyquaternium 10</strong></a><strong> </strong>(Gives skin soft feel. Formaldehyde-free.)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-polysorbate-20-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Food-Grade Polysorbate 20 and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Polysorbate 20</strong></a><strong> (</strong>Plant-based formula stabilizer. USP, food-grade, kosher quality, containing no dioxane.)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-gluconate\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Sodium Gluconate and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Sodium Gluconate </strong></a><strong>(</strong>A natural mineral that helps remove minerals from hard water.)<br/><br/><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/phenoxyethanol-in-personal-care-products-what-you-need-to-know\" title=\"Phenoxyethanol in Personal Care Products: What You Need to Know\"><strong>Phenoxyethanol</strong></a><strong>, Caprylyl Glycol, </strong><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-benzoate\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Sodium Benzoate and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Sodium Benzoate</strong></a><strong>, </strong><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-potassium-sorbate\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Potassium Sorbate and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Potassium Sorbate</strong></a><strong>  </strong>(Food-grade preservatives. Used sparingly to prevent bacteria from growing in container.)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-are-essential-oils\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What are Essential Oils?\"><strong>Essential Oils</strong></a><strong>  </strong>and/or <a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-are-fragrance-oils\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What are Fragrance Oils?\"><strong>Phthalate-Free Fragrance Oils</strong></a> (Scent)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients/what-is-citric-acid-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" title=\"What is Citric Acid and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Citric Acid</strong></a><strong> </strong>(Balances pH)</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_7GqJRH": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I custom build my own scent?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "content": "<p><em>It's pretty simple! </em></p><p>In the drop down menus you'll be able to select two of our 20+ available scents</p><p>We compound these two scents together and make sure they are compatible with/perform in our product. Our fragrance department has nearly a decade of experience working with scents, and will make sure that the two scents you chose can be smelled equally in the product you ordered</p><p>If you are looking for something customized outside of this scope to suit your brand, visit our <a href=\"/pages/private-label-information\" title=\"Private Label Information\">Private Label Solutions Page</a> for more information.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_3YrrJh": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does this product come with a pump?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "content": "<p>We do not automatically provide a pump or spout with our products because our goal is to reduce waste.</p><p>If you would like a pump or spout, we offer options as an add-on in our accessory section. </p><ul><li><a href=\"/products/1-gallon-glass-or-plastic-container-pump\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Pump | fits 1 Gallon Glass or Plastic Jug\">Gallon (Glass or Plastic) Jug Pump</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/how-to-assemble-the-wide-mouth-jar-pump\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Wide-Mouth Jar Pump Help\">1 Gallon Wide Mouth Jar Pump</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/eco-jug-help\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Eco-Jug Help\">Eco Jug Accessories</a></li><li><a href=\"/products/bucket-dispenser-pump-5-gallon\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Bucket Pump | fits 5 Gallon Bucket\">Bucket Pump</a></li><li><a href=\"/collections/drum-pumps\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"drum pumps\">Drum Pumps</a></li></ul><p><strong>Retail Ready Case (2 oz, 4 oz & 16 oz) : </strong>Retail Ready products come as shown in the case image. Pump, Sprayer or Flip-Top Cap is included if shown.</p><p>No pump is available for the <strong>24 oz Glass Jug</strong>. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
